  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="0f073385-c13a-5f05-bdf0-98a391f21bbf" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Slots are fixed 30-minute UTC units; slot allocation and reservation commit atomically.&#10;A hold lasts five minutes; confirmation requires now &lt; expiresAt, and expiry wins at equality.&#10;Availability is advisory; allocation commands reread authoritative state. Staff close only unallocated slots.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
